### Test Server (should return 200)
GET http://localhost:3000

### ===== AUTHENTICATION =====

### Register User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login User (COPY token from response body)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ===== PASTE TOKEN BELOW =====
### After you run "Login User" above, copy the token value and paste it below
### Example: @token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2OWNmMTRmNTlhNWQyNWMzNmYwZDBjMWMiLCJlbWFpbCI6InRlc3RAZXhhbXBsZS5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzUxNzkwMDIsImV4cCI6MTc3NTE4MjYwMn0.2Y-Q2UEfb8rXnFPhrd5Fo7iWBgWNzpBEDfepSYhymHw

### ===== NOTE CRUD TESTS =====

### Create Note
POST http://localhost:3000/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "My First Note",
  "content": "<h1>Hello World</h1>"
}

### Get All Notes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Single Note
GET http://localhost:3000/api/notes/69cf159a9a5d25c36f0d0c1f
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Note
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/notes/69cf159a9a5d25c36f0d0c1f
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "content": "<p>Updated</p>"
}

### Delete Note
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/notes/REPLACE_WITH_NOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

